# Docker build context exclusions. Keep the context small and, critically,
# keep host state (secrets, stale builds, local DB blobs) OUT of the image.
#
# NOTE: `apps/api/drizzle/` is deliberately NOT ignored — the `migrate`
# target needs the SQL migrations plus their meta/ snapshot files.
node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
.git
data/
.env
.env.*
*.tsbuildinfo
test-results/
playwright-report/
balance-report*.json
playtest-report*.json
docs/
.idea/
